| Table | Suggested columns |
|---|---|
| **Users** | id, name, email, password_hash, roles, department_id, manager_id, employee_level, status, created_at |
| **Departments** | id, name, cost_center, head_user_id, parent_id |
| **ExpenseClaims** | id, employee_id, title, description, business_purpose, department, project, cost_center, currency, total_amount, status, submitted_at |
| **ExpenseItems** | id, claim_id, category, amount, tax, expense_date, merchant |
